[05:46] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'company. I think it\'s quite stupid and infantile for people to be like, "Oh, no, I won\'t because it will make, you know, the Silicon Valley people rich." They\'re going to be rich anyways.'

[05:58] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'They\'re going to find another way to do it. At least this way, you get to create the stories that you\'ve had in your mind and tell the stories that you\'ve wanted for years. Frankly, I\'ve been sitting on so many screenplays for the last 20 years that'

